{'symbol': 'STT', 'date': '2022-11-11 16:30:00', 'title': 'STATE STREET TO PARTICIPATE IN THE GOLDMAN SACHS 2022 US FINANCIAL SERVICES CONFERENCE', 'text': "BOSTON--( BUSINESS WIRE )--STATE STREET CORPORATION (NYSE:STT) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS CHAIRMAN & CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, RON O'HANLEY, AND ITS VICE CHAIRMAN & CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, ERIC ABOAF, WILL PARTICIPATE IN THE GOLDMAN SACHS 2022 US FINANCIAL SERVICES CONFERENCE IN NEW YORK ON WEDNESDAY, DECEMBER 7, 2022, AT 9:20 AM ET."}